00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:13.320
As long as the Student Council approves.

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:16.620
It's more of a hobby group than a club.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:19.480
The Student Council President was really supportive.

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:25.710
She said it was wonderful how the recipes of students could be passed on through the generations.

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:29.840
I just like to cook, though.

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:37.970
Here.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:41.160
I made both the scone and the marmalade myself!

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:42.350
Try it!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:47.460
Oh, you can't eat with your hands full.

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:48.860
What should I do?

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:50.940
Oh, I know!

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:51.990
Say, "Ah!"

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.990
A-Ah!

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.200
Well?

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:00.160
It's really good!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.160
Really? I'm glad!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:07.420
My marmalade's made with 100%
natural ingredients, so it's nice and thick!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:08.980
I see.

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:10.480
Thick, huh?

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.780
That's right! Thick!

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:24.200
<i>Stop cleaning!</i>

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.280
<i>We're starting Operation Niimi Haruka!</i>

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:29.230
<i>Bring the target to the clubroom now!</i>

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:32.240
<i>Damn it. It's already time.</i>

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:38.060
<i>I'll protect Niimi-san even if it costs me my life!</i>

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:41.700
Sorry for asking you to help me take out the trash.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.380
And thanks for going out of your way.

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:45.290
Not at all. I'm happy.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:49.710
It's been forever since you asked me to go somewhere with you.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.960
O-Oh, really?

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:09.920
Mind waiting here for a second?

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.030
I need to stop by the clubroom.

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:12.110
O-Okay.

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:15.610
Take a step back.

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:22.440
Wow, this hallway is really clean.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.120
The floor's practically sparkling.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.570
Yeah, you're right.

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:28.620
Someone might slip if it's this—

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:32.340
Niimi-san! Go back to the classroom! Now!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.170
Maeda-kun, look out!

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:39.260
Got you!

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:14.760
Now, let us begin our emergency meeting.

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:18.090
I've called you here for one reason alone:

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:20.590
Miss Photogenic

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:24.850
to discuss why we're having trouble collecting photographs of this year's Miss Photogenic, Niimi Haruka.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.760
Maeda-kun! Are you okay?

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:24.850
Hang in there!

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:26.170
Maeda-kun!

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:28.850
Maeda keeps screwing up and making it difficult for us!

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:28.850
Are you okay?

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.260
Sorry.

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:31.160
Hey, don't be mean.

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:32.600
Maeda's new to this.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:35.610
And so, we'll be changing the operation.

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:39.740
Each of you will keep an eye on the target
and find whatever photo opportunity you can.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:40.610
Got it?

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:41.920
Yes, sir!

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:42.900
Uchida.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:43.620
Yes.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.720
This is your specialty.

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:46.780
Can you do it?

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:49.250
Leave the stealth photography to me.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:53.200
All right. Dismissed.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:54.000
Miss Photogenic

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:55.260
I eagerly anticipate the fruits of your labor.

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:58.520
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:04.240
<i>There's no telling when Uchida or the other two will go after Niimi-san.</i>

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:07.520
<i>It's worse than being used to lure her out.</i>

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.020
<i>I have no choice.</i>

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:12.390
<i>I must do this.</i>

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:14.400
<i>I'll protect them!</i>

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.900
<i>I'll be the one to protect Niimi-san's panties!</i>

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:28.760
To take clear photographs seemingly frozen in time,

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:34.420
increase the aperture and increase the shutter speed.

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:44.970
Maeda-senpai!

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:47.320
Did they come out well?

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:48.420
Yeah.

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:50.880
Hopefully you'll find them useful for checking your form.

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:54.380
I'll give the photos to Kanon later tonight.

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:55.480
She'll give them to you.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:58.120
Okay, thank you.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:01.990
And thanks for going out of your way for me too.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:04.060
Don't mention it.

00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:05.990
I'm glad I could help.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:10.160
I've been practicing gymnastics until I left middle school,

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:13.250
so I haven't really gotten the hang of rhythmic gymnastics yet.

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:15.250
You haven't?

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:16.420
Yes.

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:19.000
Rhythmic gymnastics is a competition of aesthetics.

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:23.510
Up until now, technical difficulty was my only concern,

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:28.760
so I don't really know how to
make a routine look beautiful.

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:33.770
That's why I need to keep practicing!

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:36.020
I see.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:39.500
Well, I should stop disturbing you, so I'll be going now.

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:40.820
You aren't disturbing me at all.

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:43.800
Thank you so much.

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:45.030
I'm rooting for you.

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:48.530
Come watch our practices again, Senpai!

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:50.320
Of course.

00:22:06.770 --> 00:22:08.740
Hang in there, Mai-chan.

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:43.360
So amazing!

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:46.660
Not only did you touch those enormous Rinaboobs,

00:23:46.660 --> 00:23:49.480
you even got the slender Muroto to pose for some sexy shots.

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:50.570
Impressive.

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:53.540
I commend the range of your strike zone.

00:23:53.540 --> 00:23:58.920
Keep it up and capture the borderline eroticism of every pretty girl in the school!

00:23:58.920 --> 00:24:03.040
At this rate, the school's in for a big surprise!

00:24:05.230 --> 00:24:09.760
Geez! You have to be nice to girls!
